<h3><strong>Why &#8220;In-House&#8221; Hand Brush Work Changes Everything for You</strong></h3>
<p>Most brands outsource their embellishment and surface decoration to large factories, where your fabric is one of thousands moving through an assembly line. At The Fabloom, our hand brush work happens inside our own studio, under the watchful eye of our artisans — and that changes everything.</p>
